{"slug":"alpha-glucosidase-inhibitors","title":"α-葡萄糖苷酶抑制劑","subtitle":"Alpha-glucosidase inhibitors(AGI)","category":"drug","aliases":["Acarbose","Miglitol","Voglibose","α-glucosidase inhibitor","醣苷酶抑制劑","糖苷酶抑制劑"],"dzTags":["糖尿病"],"reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-09-25","references":[{"title":"American Diabetes Association. Standards of Care in Diabetes(最新年度版)","url":"https://diabetesjournals.org/care"},{"title":"OpenStax. Pharmacology for Nurses, Antidiabetic Drugs(CC BY-NC-SA 4.0)","note":"僅作為撰寫參考"}],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"抑制小腸刷狀緣的 α-葡萄糖苷酶 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"延緩澱粉與雙醣分解吸收"}]},{"type":"text","value":" → 主要降低"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"餐後血糖"}]},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"隨餐第一口"}]},{"type":"text","value":"一起服用。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"常見副作用:"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"脹氣、排氣增加、腹瀉"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(未消化的醣被腸道細菌發酵)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"與其他藥併用發生低血糖時,要給"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"葡萄糖"}]},{"type":"text","value":"(蔗糖、澱粉的分解被抑制)。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"mechanism","depth":2,"number":"二、","title":"作用機轉","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"澱粉與雙醣(蔗糖、麥芽糖)必須被小腸絨毛刷狀緣的 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"α-葡萄糖苷酶"}]},{"type":"text","value":"分解成單醣才能吸收。AGI 競爭性抑制這些酵素,使醣類吸收"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"延後、分散到小腸較遠端"}]},{"type":"text","value":",餐後血糖高峰變低變平。不影響胰島素分泌,單用不會低血糖。"}]}]}},{"id":"agents","depth":2,"number":"三、","title":"代表藥物","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Acarbose"}]},{"type":"text","value":":幾乎不被吸收"},{"type":"text","value":",作用在腸道。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Miglitol"}]},{"type":"text","value":":會被吸收"},{"type":"text","value":",由腎臟排出。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Voglibose"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"indications","depth":2,"number":"四、","title":"適應症","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"第二型糖尿病,以"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"餐後高血糖"}]},{"type":"text","value":"為主、飲食以澱粉為主者(亞洲人飲食效果不錯)。"}]}]}},{"id":"adverse-effects","depth":2,"number":"五、","title":"副作用與禁忌","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腸胃道"}]},{"type":"text","value":":脹氣"},{"type":"text","value":"、排氣、腹瀉、腹痛——由小劑量開始可減輕。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"禁忌"},{"type":"text","value":":發炎性腸道疾病"},{"type":"text","value":"、腸阻塞或容易阻塞者、慢性吸收不良、嚴重腎功能不全。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"高劑量 acarbose 偶有肝指數上升。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"nursing","depth":2,"number":"六、","title":"護理重點與衛教","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"與每餐第一口飯一起嚼服或吞服"}]},{"type":"text","value":";沒有吃含醣食物的那一餐不需要吃。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"與"},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"sulfonylureas"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"磺醯脲類"}]},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"insulin"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"胰島素"}]},{"type":"text","value":"併用時若低血糖,要吃"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"葡萄糖片"}]},{"type":"text","value":"或含葡萄糖的飲料(或牛奶中的乳糖),蔗糖、方糖效果差。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"說明腸胃症狀通常隨時間減輕。"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]}]}},{"id":"questions","depth":2,"number":"七、","title":"相關考題","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"k-questions","properties":{"tag":"","keyword":"(acarbose|miglitol|voglibose|glucosidase|糖苷酶|醣苷酶|減少糖分的吸收)","ids":"","limit":"4","qkey":"alpha-glucosidase-inhibitors#questions"},"children":[]}]}}],"embed